d of Yahweh was to Haggai a second time on the twenty-fourth of the month, saying,","br":1,"sp":{"w":[[0,3,"c:H1961"],[4,7,"H1697"],[8,12,"H1697"],[13,15,"H1697"],[16,22,"H3068"],[23,26,"c:H1961"],[27,29,"H0413"],[30,36,"H2292a"],[37,38,"H8145"],[39,45,"H8145"],[46,50,"H8145"],[51,53,"b:H6242"],[54,57,"b:H6242"],[58,64,"b:H6242"],[65,71,"c:H0702"],[72,74,"l:H2320"],[75,78,"l:H2320"],[79,84,"l:H2320"],[86,92,"l:H0559"]]}},{"n":21,"text":"“Speak to Zerubbabel, the governor of Judah, saying, ‘I {am} shaking the heavens and the earth.","q":1,"sp":{"w":[[1,6,"H0559"],[7,9,"H0413"],[10,20,"H2216"],[22,25,"H6346"],[26,34,"H6346"],[35,37,"H6346"],[38,43,"H3063"],[45,51,"l:H0559"],[54,55,"H0589"],[57,59,"H7493"],[61,68,"H7493"],[69,72,"d:H8064"],[73,80,"d:H8064"],[81,84,"d:H0776"],[85,88,"d:H0776"],[89,94,"d:H0776"]]}},{"n":22,"text":"And I will overthrow the throne of kingdoms and I will destroy the strength of the kingdoms of the nations! And I will overthrow the chariot and its rider, and the horses and their riders will fall, a man by the sword of his brother.","q":1,"sp":{"w":[[0,3,"c:H2015"],[4,5,"c:H2015"],[6,10,"c:H2015"],[11,20,"c:H2015"],[21,24,"H3678"],[25,31,"H3678"],[32,34,"H3678"],[35,43,"H4467"],[44,47,"c:H8045"],[48,49,"c:H8045"],[50,54,"c:H8045"],[55,62,"c:H8045"],[63,66,"H2392"],[67,75,"H2392"],[76,78,"H2392"],[79,82,"H4467"],[83,91,"H4467"],[92,94,"H4467"],[95,98,"d:H1471a"],[99,106,"d:H1471a"],[108,111,"c:H2015"],[112,113,"c:H2015"],[114,118,"c:H2015"],[119,128,"c:H2015"],[129,132,"H4818"],[133,140,"H4818"],[141,144,"c:H7392"],[145,148,"c:H7392"],[149,154,"c:H7392"],[156,159,"c:H3381"],[160,163,"H5483b"],[164,170,"H5483b"],[171,174,"c:H7392"],[175,180,"c:H7392"],[181,187,"c:H7392"],[188,192,"c:H3381"],[193,197,"c:H3381"],[199,200,"H0376"],[201,204,"H0376"],[205,207,"b:H2719"],[208,211,"b:H2719"],[212,217,"b:H2719"],[218,220,"b:H2719"],[221,224,"H0251"],[225,232,"H0251"]]}},{"n":23,"text":"On that day’—the declaration of Yahweh of Armies—‘I will take you, 